OL,3,GNEWSAOur love is taken for granted,
OL,4,Akinship carers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies who had minutes to make the
OL,7,Fdecision to look after a child have
OL,8,Fsaid there needs to be more support for
OL,9,Fothers in their position.
OL,11,FKinship care sees a family member or
OL,12,Ffriend step in to bring up a child and
OL,13,Fkeep them out of the care system.
OL,15,FSix months after the Reverend Paul
OL,16,FKerry and his wife Gaby, from Cumbria,
OL,17,Fbecame the godparents of a little girl,
OL,18,Fthey were contacted by social services
OL,19,Fasking them to care for her for a
OL,20,Fweekend.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
